---
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../../lib/siteConfig';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const { certifications } = SITE_CONFIG;

const allProducts = await getCollection('products');
const productCount = allProducts.length;
---

<section class="trust-proof">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading
      title="Качество, подтверждённое документально"
      subtitle="Сертификаты и 10+ лет опыта экспорта в Россию и другие страны"
    />

    <!-- Stats strip -->
    <div class="trust-proof__stats">
      <div class="trust-proof__stat">
        <strong>10+</strong>
        <span>Лет экспорта</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-proof__stat">
        <strong>15</strong>
        <span>Стран поставок</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-proof__stat">
        <strong>{productCount}+</strong>
        <span>Видов продукции</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-proof__stat">
        <strong>50</strong>
        <span>м² минимальный заказ</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-proof__grid">
      <div class="trust-proof__content">
        <h3>Надёжность, которую вы можете проверить</h3>
        <ul class="trust-proof__list">
          <li>
            <strong>Собственная фабрика</strong>
            <span>Полный контроль на каждом этапе производства в Гуандуне, Китай</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Экспорт в Россию с 2013 года</strong>
            <span>Понимаем требования рынка РФ, таможенные процедуры и сертификацию</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Международные сертификаты</strong>
            <span>BSCI, ISO 9001, FSC, CE, RoHS — полный пакет для России</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Прозрачность производства</strong>
            <span>Фото- и видеоотчёты по каждой партии на всех этапах</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-proof__certs">
        {certifications.map((cert) => (
          <a href={cert.file} class="trust-proof__cert" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" download>
            <div class="trust-proof__cert-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M12 2l3 3h5v5l3 3-3 3v5h-5l-3 3-3-3H4v-5l-3-3 3-3V5h5l3-3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="trust-proof__cert-info">
              <span class="trust-proof__cert-name">{cert.name}</span>
              <span class="trust-proof__cert-action">Скачать PDF</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-proof__factory">
      <div class="trust-proof__factory-visual">
        <img src="/assets/images/factory/factory-05.jpg" alt="Фабрика в Гуандуне, Китай" class="trust-proof__factory-img" loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
        <div class="trust-proof__factory-pattern" style="display:none;">
          <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none" opacity="0.15">
            <rect x="10" y="10" width="100" height="40" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <rect x="20" y="18" width="25" height="24" rx="2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.3"/>
            <rect x="52" y="18" width="48" height="24" rx="2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.15"/>
            <rect x="10" y="58" width="45" height="52" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <rect x="20" y="70" width="25" height="30" rx="2" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.2"/>
            <rect x="62" y="58" width="48" height="52" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M62 80h48M86 58v52" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-proof__factory-badge">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
            <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M7 10l2 2 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Производство в Гуандуне, Китай</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-proof__factory-text">
        <h3>Реальное производство с полным контролем</h3>
        <p>Мы не трейдеры — у нас собственная фабрика в провинции Гуандун. Вы можете запросить онлайн-экскурсию по производству, свежие фото вашей партии или видеоотчёт о загрузке контейнера.</p>
        <div class="trust-proof__factory-actions">
          <a href="/kontakty/" class="trust-proof__factory-btn">
            Запросить видео фабрики
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l8 8M11 3v8H3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .trust-proof {
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  /* Stats strip */
  .trust-proof__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .trust-proof__stat {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 28px 16px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-light);
  }

  .trust-proof__stat strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .trust-proof__stat span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  /* Main grid */
  .trust-proof__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .trust-proof__content h3 {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .trust-proof__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .trust-proof__list li {
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-stone-light);
  }

  .trust-proof__list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .trust-proof__list li strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .trust-proof__list li span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Certification cards */
  .trust-proof__certs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-content: start;
  }

  .trust-proof__cert {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 18px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-light);
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .trust-proof__cert:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .trust-proof__cert-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .trust-proof__cert:hover .trust-proof__cert-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .trust-proof__cert-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .trust-proof__cert-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .trust-proof__cert-action {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-lighter);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .trust-proof__cert:hover .trust-proof__cert-action {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* Factory section */
  .trust-proof__factory {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-visual {
    height: 320px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-primary-light) 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--color-white);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0.15;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-white);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-text {
    padding: 40px 40px 40px 0;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-text h3 {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-text p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .trust-proof__factory-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-dark);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .trust-proof__stats {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .trust-proof__grid,
    .trust-proof__factory {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .trust-proof__certs {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .trust-proof__factory-text {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .trust-proof__factory-visual {
      height: 200px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .trust-proof__stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .trust-proof__certs {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
